{"id":50950,"date":"2026-05-02T06:47:29","date_gmt":"2026-05-02T05:47:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50950"},"modified":"2026-09-03T02:05:09","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T01:05:09","slug":"vodafone-10k","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vodafone-10k\/","title":{"rendered":"Vodafone 10k 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vodafone 10k 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Vodafone 10k 2027<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das corridas de estrada mais emblem\u00e1ticas e participadas de Portugal, realizando-se em paralelo com a prestigiada <strong>EDP Meia Maratona de Lisboa<\/strong>. O grande atrativo desta prova \u00e9 a oportunidade inesquec\u00edvel de <strong>atravessar a p\u00e9 a Ponte 25 de Abril<\/strong>, desfrutando de uma vista panor\u00e2mica deslumbrante sobre o <strong>Rio Tejo<\/strong> e a capital antes de mergulhar num ambiente de festa e supera\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva contagiante.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida agendada para as <strong>10:15<\/strong> no tabuleiro da ponte (junto \u00e0 pra\u00e7a de portagem do Pragal) e chegada triunfal em frente ao monumental <strong>Mosteiro dos Jer\u00f3nimos, em Bel\u00e9m<\/strong>, os 10 km s\u00e3o integralmente cronometrados e contam com um perfil maioritariamente plano e favor\u00e1vel. Quer estejas focado em bater o teu recorde pessoal aos 10 km ou \u00e0 procura de uma experi\u00eancia de atletismo memor\u00e1vel no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Lisboa, esta prova oferece um abastecimento de excel\u00eancia, transporte gratuito pela Fertagus e uma medalha de finalista ic\u00f3nica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u00e0s 10:15<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ponte 25 de Abril (Portagem \/ Pragal) \u2013 Meta em Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida Cronometrada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2h20m<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vodafone 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Geral:<\/strong> 26.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Abertas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Vodafone 10k 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida oficial marcada para as 10:15 no tabuleiro da Ponte 25 de Abril.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o acesso \u00e0 partida na Ponte 25 de Abril?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O acesso \u00e0 zona de partida \u00e9 efetuado obrigatoriamente atrav\u00e9s dos comboios da Fertagus com paragem na Esta\u00e7\u00e3o do Pragal, gratuitos para todos os atletas mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal oficial da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica instalada a linha de meta e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A meta est\u00e1 localizada na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, junto ao Mosteiro dos Jer\u00f3nimos em Bel\u00e9m (Lisboa). O tempo limite oficial de conclus\u00e3o (cut-off) \u00e9 de 2h20m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de atleta e dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento dos dorsais e t-shirts oficiais decorre na Sport Expo (Centro de Congressos de Lisboa, Junqueira) de quinta-feira a s\u00e1bado anteriores ao evento (4, 5 e 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027), das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no dia da corrida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A corrida de 10 km tem classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e chip de cronometragem?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a Vodafone 10K \u00e9 uma prova oficial de atletismo com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica integrado no dorsal, disponibilizando classifica\u00e7\u00f5es gerais e por escal\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vodafone 10k 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ponte 25 de Abril (Portagem \/ Pragal) \u2013 Meta em Bel\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Maratona Clube de Portugal\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Vodafone 10k 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida oficial marcada para as 10:15 no tabuleiro da Ponte 25 de Abril.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o acesso \u00e0 partida na Ponte 25 de Abril?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O acesso \u00e0 zona de partida \u00e9 efetuado obrigatoriamente atrav\u00e9s dos comboios da Fertagus com paragem na Esta\u00e7\u00e3o do Pragal, gratuitos para todos os atletas mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal oficial da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica instalada a linha de meta e qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A meta est\u00e1 localizada na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, junto ao Mosteiro dos Jer\u00f3nimos em Bel\u00e9m (Lisboa). O tempo limite oficial de conclus\u00e3o (cut-off) \u00e9 de 2h20m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de atleta e dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento dos dorsais e t-shirts oficiais decorre na Sport Expo (Centro de Congressos de Lisboa, Junqueira) de quinta-feira a s\u00e1bado anteriores ao evento (4, 5 e 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027), das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no dia da corrida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A corrida de 10 km tem classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e chip de cronometragem?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a Vodafone 10K \u00e9 uma prova oficial de atletismo com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica integrado no dorsal, disponibilizando classifica\u00e7\u00f5es gerais e por escal\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a prova.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50952,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50950","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Vodafone-10k-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50950","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":